          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yocuwa goyo ng’om maeno ceke, man ng’om gudi, ku ng’om ma yor ariwa ma piny, ku ng’om poga, ku ng’om m’alora, kud ubimo migi ceke; eweko moko ngo m’udong’, ento enyotho gin ceke m’uyuyo kot, calu Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, ung’olo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yocuwa goyogi gambre Kadec-barnea cil kum Gaza, ku ng’om ceke mi Gocen, cil kum Gibeon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo maeni ceke ku ng’om migi Yocuwa maku i nindo acel, kum Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, ukiedo pir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.10.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 10:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yocuwa dwogo, ku Israel ceke gikugi, ba kagonjo i Gilgal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.10.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
